### Cake Platform API - Verification & Documents
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/verification
@authUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/auth

### =========================================
### 0. Authenticate to get Token
### =========================================
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "owner@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store the token from the login response
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### =========================================
### 1. Upload Document
### =========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "documentType": "FSSAI_CERTIFICATE",
    "fileUrl": "https://example.com/documents/fssai_cert_123.pdf"
}

### =========================================
### 2. View My Documents
### =========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
